msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Lista de verificación de migración"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:611
msgid "For a clean port to v5.0.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Para un porte limpio a la v5.0.0, el trabajo típico es:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:613
msgid ""
"Replace ``import sensor`` with ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` and "
"translate every ``set_*``/``get_*`` call to its :class:`csi.CSI` accessor "
"(:ref:`the csi migration <v5_0_0_s1>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reemplace ``import sensor`` por ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` y traduzca "
"cada llamada ``set_*``/``get_*`` a su accesor de :class:`csi.CSI` (:ref:`la "
"migración a csi <v5_0_0_s1>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:616
msgid ""
"Wrap coordinate arguments to ``img.draw_*``, :meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel`,"
" and :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuples (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Envuelva en tuplas los argumentos de coordenadas de ``img.draw_*``, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel` y :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` (:ref:`los "
"cambios del módulo image <v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:619
msgid ""
"Drop ``()`` from attrtuple result accessors if you want the new idiomatic "
"form, or leave the old style alone since attrtuples still support callable "
"accessors (:ref:`the image module changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Elimine los ``()`` de los accesores de resultado attrtuple si desea la nueva"
" forma idiomática, o deje el estilo antiguo tal cual, ya que los attrtuples "
"siguen admitiendo accesores invocables (:ref:`los cambios del módulo image "
"<v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:622
msgid ""
"Audit :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression`, and any "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` family choice (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Audite :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression` y cualquier elección de familia de "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` (:ref:`los cambios del módulo image "
"<v5_0_0_s2>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:626
msgid ""
"Rename ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init` calls; remove "
"``protocol.poll()`` and ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`the protocol module changes "
"<v5_0_0_s4>`)."
msgstr ""
"Renombre ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` en las llamadas a :func:`protocol.init`;"
" elimine ``protocol.poll()`` y ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`los cambios del "
"módulo protocol <v5_0_0_s4>`)."

